&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This article was originally published on &lt;a href="https://dingjiu1989-hue.github.io/en/compare/component-library-comparison.html" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;AI Study Room&lt;/a&gt;. For the full version with working code examples and related articles, visit the original post.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
